WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.847
Welcome to Pure Clinics, the skin clinic in Nijmegen and Uden.

00:00:03.847 --> 00:00:10.335
In a few minutes you will see how the new app works for your clients, and how the team runs everything in the admin panel.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.325
The home screen shows your next appointment right away. Not sure about a treatment?

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:22.376
Start with a free intake: a skin therapist looks at your skin and gives honest advice.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:31.247
Rather just ask? Type or say it to the assistant, for example: can I have a free intake in Nijmegen on Wednesday evening?

00:00:31.247 --> 00:00:34.208
The assistant finds a time and books it for you.

00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:43.768
Book lists every Pure Clinics treatment: from acne and couperose to pigmentation, skin rejuvenation and permanent hair removal.

00:00:43.768 --> 00:00:46.913
First you choose your location, Nijmegen or Uden.

00:00:48.317 --> 00:00:58.299
Every treatment has its own page. It tells you how it works, how many sessions you usually need, how long recovery takes, and what you can do yourself afterwards.

00:00:59.683 --> 00:01:05.074
Laser hair removal is priced per zone. Tick your zones and you see the cost straight away.

00:01:05.074 --> 00:01:08.607
With the five plus one package the sixth treatment is free.

00:01:10.017 --> 00:01:15.085
The home screen shows the Pure Clinics deals, for women, men and students.

00:01:15.085 --> 00:01:18.236
One tap and the deal is ready in your booking.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:29.352
Laser and most skin treatments come in a series. The app keeps track of how far along you are, and tells you when your next treatment fits, with the same skin therapist.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:38.223
My Pure holds your appointments and orders, the membership with your perks, and both clinics with today's opening hours.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:39.967
One tap and you are calling.

00:01:41.383 --> 00:01:47.634
The webshop has the aftercare your skin therapist recommends, like sun protection after laser.

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:50.759
Have it delivered, or pick it up at the clinic.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:57.383
And on a computer everything works just the same, as an ordinary website, in six languages.

00:01:58.783 --> 00:02:07.968
Then the admin panel, for the team. At the top are today's numbers: revenue, the number of treatments, how full the rooms are, and the webshop.

00:02:09.383 --> 00:02:14.022
Below you see Nijmegen and Uden from above. Each chair is a treatment room.

00:02:14.022 --> 00:02:17.299
Green means someone is being treated there right now.

00:02:18.683 --> 00:02:23.742
The diary shows the whole day per room, each clinic on its own opening hours.

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:25.648
Each block is an appointment.

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:31.501
Treatment plans shows which clients are due for their next session.

00:02:31.501 --> 00:02:35.222
One click sends a reminder, so nobody drops out halfway.

00:02:36.617 --> 00:02:44.951
On the right, everything that just happened comes in: new bookings, free intakes, new members and orders, newest at the top.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:50.281
At the bottom you see the week's revenue, and tips from the numbers.

00:02:50.281 --> 00:02:54.905
For example: laser season has started, so put the laser deals in the newsletter.

00:02:56.317 --> 00:03:03.444
Want to see a whole day at once? Press Play the day. And the Guide button walks you through everything step by step.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:10.604
That was Pure Clinics: one app for your clients, and one overview for your team.

00:03:10.604 --> 00:03:11.036
Enjoy!
